[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0529","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0529.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-25203","title":"Samsung MagicINFO 9 Server 默认权限配置不当本地提权漏洞","description":"Samsung MagicINFO 9 Server 存在不安全的默认权限配置漏洞（CWE-276），安装目录的访问控制列表（ACL）设置过于宽松，导致低权限本地用户可替换或修改 MagicINFO 安装目录中的应用程序二进制文件。攻击者只需拥有本地低权限账户即可利用该漏洞，通过替换恶意文件触发服务重启或系统调用，实现权限提升至 SYSTEM。该漏洞影响 MagicINFO 9 Server 21.1091.1 以下版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。Samsung 已发布安全更新建议用户升级至 21.1091.1 及以上版本并限制安装目录文件系统权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-25203"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-04-10T02:16:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:24:18Z","remediation":"立即将 Samsung MagicINFO 9 Server 升级至 21.1091.1 或更高版本。同时手动收紧 MagicINFO 安装目录（默认 C:\\Program Files\\Samsung MagicINFO\\）的 NTFS 权限，移除普通用户（Users/Everyone）的写入和修改权限，仅保留 SYSTEM 和管理员完全控制权。如无法立即升级，可通过 Windows 安全策略限制本地非授权用户登录服务器作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://security.samsungtv.com/securityUpdates","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/257ebb29696cc311841c79ca4ceb0162bf5df44a/cves/2026/25xxx/CVE-2026-25203.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/04aa8ca564639267b9d3e24749bc97bd87299d48/2026/25xxx/CVE-2026-25203.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-25203.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-25203.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2026/04/GHSA-wvrj-cr9g-752f/GHSA-wvrj-cr9g-752f.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4bd823fa5ff72ec859371ff3ef0f5e18be2f2c77/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-25203.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/08ea89e8807d0d5cf7150243c834721985237c9e/CVEs_log/2026-04-11_en.md","https://github.com/mrhenrike/EmbedXPL-Forge/blob/55da15272f066aa9d0dde3f336f7d474e1f45ac1/embedxpl/modules/exploits/smart_tv/samsung_magicinfo/default_perms_lpe_cve_2026_25203.py","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-25203.json","https://github.com/Vulnogram/Vulnogram.github.io/blob/4076c7e56adc641c181faf80bf2446aa219db5a6/rss/samsung.tv_appliance.xml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0529.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0529.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0555","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0555.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-32861","title":"NI LabVIEW 越界写入漏洞","description":"NI LabVIEW 在加载特制的 .lvclass 文件时存在越界写入漏洞，由于对畸形 LVCLASS 文件内容缺乏充分的边界检查，攻击者可构造恶意 .lvclass 文件并诱使用户在 LabVIEW 中打开，触发内存损坏，导致信息泄露或任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 NI LabVIEW 2026 Q1 (26.1.0) 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 8.5，危害等级高。攻击需要用户交互，无法远程直接利用，但结合钓鱼等手段可造成较大危害。NI 官方已发布安全公告，建议用户升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-32861"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-04-07T20:16:24Z","updated":"2026-07-24T23:10:00Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 LabVIEW：2026 Q1 用户升级至 Patch 1 或更高版本，2025 Q3 用户升级至 Patch 4 或更高版本，2024 Q3 用户升级至 Patch 6 或更高版本，2023 Q3 用户升级至 Patch 9 或更高版本。可通过 NI Package Manager 或 NI 软件下载页面获取更新。2022 及更早版本已停止主流支持，建议升级到受支持的最新版本。在无法立即升级的情况下，避免打开来源不明的 .lvclass 文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.ni.com/en/support/security/available-critical-and-security-updates-for-ni-software/2026/lv-class-file-parsing-memory-corruption-vulnerability-in-ni-labview.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2026/32xxx/CVE-2026-32861.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/51922162e2cbb5914a11ad939c724b426142677c/content/posts/cve-2026-32861.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2026/32xxx/CVE-2026-32861.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-32861.md","https://github.com/ni/product-security-center/blob/7ca65928b6784ba5233521dd8a4b24877dacdb44/csaf/advisories/2026/ni_cve-2026-32861.json.sha512","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2026/04/GHSA-8q47-ghm9-m53q/GHSA-8q47-ghm9-m53q.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/98f785d4de3da29b2a31131d1ba99ceeb9ee0484/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-32861.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/08ea89e8807d0d5cf7150243c834721985237c9e/CVEs_log/2026-04-08_en.md","https://github.com/wooluo/vuln_crawler/blob/32f2293479ff686679659fbb5e0a89dfb65ba641/vulnerability_reports/vulnerability_report_2026-04-10_10-12-41.md","https://github.com/delikely/ZDI_Advisories/blob/6b55e3ba1a5f6029db981377240e35731b742a92/advisories/2026/ZDI-26-291.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0555.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0554","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0554.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-32860","title":"NI LabVIEW LVLIB文件解析越界写入漏洞","description":"NI LabVIEW 在加载恶意构造的 .lvlib 文件时存在越界写入漏洞（CWE-787），由于程序未对文件数据边界进行充分校验，攻击者可通过诱导用户打开特制的 .lvlib 库文件触发内存损坏，导致敏感信息泄露或任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 LabVIEW 2026 Q1（26.1.0）及之前版本，攻击需要用户交互，CVSS 评分 8.5，危害等级高。建议用户尽快升级至最新版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-32860"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-04-07T20:16:24Z","updated":"2026-07-24T23:10:00Z","remediation":"建议立即将 NI LabVIEW 升级至以下对应修补版本：LabVIEW 2026 Q1 用户升级至 Patch 1 或更高版本，LabVIEW 2025 用户升级至 2025 Q3 Patch 4 或更高版本，LabVIEW 2024 用户升级至 2024 Q3 Patch 6 或更高版本，LabVIEW 2023 用户升级至 2023 Q3 Patch 9 或更高版本。可通过 NI Package Manager 或 NI 官方软件下载页面获取更新。如无法立即升级，应避免打开来源不明的 .lvlib 项目库文件，并限制 LabVIEW 对不可信文件的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.ni.com/en/support/security/available-critical-and-security-updates-for-ni-software/2026/lv-project-library-file-parsing-memory-corruption-vulnerability-in-ni-labview.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ac44cfd6537e05d45dfec0ed67b6d47bebeee2b/cves/2026/32xxx/CVE-2026-32860.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/51922162e2cbb5914a11ad939c724b426142677c/content/posts/cve-2026-32860.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a4b68cf758bc6730b65b4f54ef98a7f612a68b51/2026/32xxx/CVE-2026-32860.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-32860.md","https://github.com/ni/product-security-center/blob/7ca65928b6784ba5233521dd8a4b24877dacdb44/csaf/advisories/2026/ni_cve-2026-32860.json.sha512","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2026/04/GHSA-xrvx-v68m-344q/GHSA-xrvx-v68m-344q.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/98f785d4de3da29b2a31131d1ba99ceeb9ee0484/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-32860.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/08ea89e8807d0d5cf7150243c834721985237c9e/CVEs_log/2026-04-08_en.md","https://github.com/wooluo/vuln_crawler/blob/32f2293479ff686679659fbb5e0a89dfb65ba641/vulnerability_reports/vulnerability_report_2026-04-10_10-12-41.md","https://github.com/delikely/ZDI_Advisories/blob/6b55e3ba1a5f6029db981377240e35731b742a92/advisories/2026/ZDI-26-290.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0554.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0060","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0060.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-22679","title":"泛微 E-cology 10 Dubbo 反序列化远程代码执行漏洞","description":"泛微 E-cology 10.0 的 /papi/esearch/data/devops/dubboApi/debug/method 接口存在缺少身份认证的远程代码执行漏洞（CWE-306）。未经认证的远程攻击者可通过构造特制 POST 请求，控制 interfaceName 和 methodName 参数调用已暴露的调试功能，进而执行任意命令，完全控制目标服务器。该漏洞影响 20260312 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。Shadowserver Foundation 已于 2026 年 3 月 31 日观测到在野利用。厂商已在 20260312 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-22679"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-04-07T13:16:45Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:20:13Z","remediation":"立即升级至泛微 E-cology 10.0 20260312 及以上版本，该版本已修复 /papi/esearch/data/devops/dubboApi/debug/method 端点未经身份验证即可远程执行命令的问题。如无法立即升级，可在中间件层面（如 Nginx/WAF）配置规则拦截对 /papi/esearch/data/devops/dubboApi/debug/method 路径的 POST 请求，或通过防火墙限制对该端点的外部访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://h4cker.zip/post/d5d211/","https://ti.qianxin.com/vulnerability/notice-detail/1760","https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/weaver-e-cology-unauthenticated-rce-via-dubboapi-debug-endpoint","https://www.weaver.com.cn/cs/securityDownload.html#","https://blog.vega.io/posts/cve-2026-22679-weaver-ecology-exploitation/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/2026/CVE-2026-22679.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cb31df1745cb795b327f3818ad29a4b3cf1cd125/cves/2026/22xxx/CVE-2026-22679.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-04-07/TIER_2_CVE-2026-22679.md","https://github.com/XiaomingX/data-cve-poc-py-v1/blob/2384dcccef665cfd62dafa8a075b204cad1f98e9/2026/CVE-2026-22679/CVE-2026-22679_Weaver_Ecology_RCE.nse","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/fa30538a41a7f2860cb7778b721229e52f8c6dd2/2026/22xxx/CVE-2026-22679.json","https://github.com/mthcht/ThreatIntel-Reports/blob/0c2473c24dfecb383fdaacf2e465a9c66649856e/Intel%20Reports/thehackernews_com/2026_05_weaver-e-cology-rce-flaw-cve-2026-22679_html/link.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/278bea3f9397da219bb29098ecf3912d7bfe0645/content/posts/cve-2026-22679.md","https://github.com/Vu1nT0tal/yarb/blob/2853b83f9525211a3c7c25f2ab4e006505d500ad/archive/2026/2026-05-06.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/d30a7bcebc198654ff8a91e8057888a5ea5e4392/cve/CVE-2026-22679.html","https://github.com/spbavarva/0day.digest/blob/b949c31175166c82579fc4800f92f41891666abc/_posts/2026-05-05-weaver-ecology-cve-2026-22679-rce.md","https://github.com/keraattin/CVE-2026-22679","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-22679"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0060.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0060.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0060.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0099","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0099.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-34197","title":"Apache ActiveMQ Jolokia 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apache ActiveMQ Web 控制台中的 Jolokia JMX-HTTP 桥接端点（/api/jolokia/）存在不当输入验证与代码注入漏洞。经过身份认证的攻击者可利用默认 Jolokia 访问策略允许对 ActiveMQ MBeans 执行操作的特性，通过调用 addNetworkConnector 或 addConnector 方法传入特制的 discovery URI，触发 VM 传输协议的 brokerConfig 参数加载远程恶意 Spring XML 应用上下文。由于 Spring 的 ResourceXmlApplicationContext 在 BrokerService 验证配置之前即实例化所有单例 bean，通过 bean 工厂方法（如 Runtime.exec）可在代理 JVM 上实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Apache ActiveMQ 5.19.4 以下版本及 6.0.0 至 6.2.3 以下版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高危。用户应升级至 5.19.4 或 6.2.3 版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-34197"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-04-07T09:16:20Z","updated":"2026-07-15T02:20:30Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Apache ActiveMQ 5.19.4 或 6.2.3 及以上版本（官方已修复 addNetworkConnector 中 vm:// 传输协议的远程加载问题）。在反向代理/WAF 层面限制 /api/jolokia/ 端点仅允许受信 IP 访问；修改 jolokia-access.xml 将 org.apache.activemq:* 的 exec 操作权限设为 none 或仅保留只读操作。将 ActiveMQ Web 控制台绑定内网管理地址，禁用默认 admin/admin 凭据并启用强密码策略。若无法立即升级，可在 6.0.0-6.1.1 版本中临时禁用 Jolokia 端点或通过防火墙限制 8161 端口访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://activemq.apache.org/security-advisories.data/CVE-2026-34197-announcement.txt","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/04/06/3","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-34197","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2455869","https://security.access.redhat.com/data/csaf/v2/vex/2026/cve-2026-34197.json","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2026-34197","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2026/CVE-2026-34197.yaml","https://github.com/pssec-io/CVE-2026-34197","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/f7944fe38a3988ee533761e6cdb5e68d67eefff2/activemq/CVE-2026-34197/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f2737ed54bc77e69eee49ea0fc8ad75416232e93/2026/CVE-2026-34197.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/47b5b37845c422b41f7f77baee4751638de71f26/http/cves/2026/CVE-2026-34197.yaml","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/%E4%B8%AD%E9%97%B4%E4%BB%B6%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E/Apache%20ActiveMQ%20Jolokia%20%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20CVE-2026-34197.md","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/edea45bcf3f5f232d6349d094e3ed87f8aba3ba7/doc/2026-04/Apache%20ActiveMQ%20%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20(CVE-2026-34197).md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/8c8fc2aa7ae119f7163aab3170ab59022c4e4e32/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-34197.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-34197.md","https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflare-docs/blob/7672b321c8510a9b81b0e2f7db500f2d7ddabe16/src/content/changelog/waf/2026-04-21-waf-release.mdx","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/0ebf8eac5e6d2af2400b71f0ba35608811c9cff6/references/CVE-2026-34197-2026-05-02-0005","https://github.com/oscs1024/VulnIntel/blob/f62012ff68e6011291b2851d1c7ccdb8a587c013/2026-04/ActiveMQ%20Jolokia%20%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20(CVE-2026-34197).md","https://github.com/Catherines77/ActiveMQ-EXPtools","https://github.com/dinosn/CVE-2026-34197","https://github.com/dinosn/apache-activemq-rce-research","https://github.com/DEVSECURITYSPRO/CVE-2026-34197","https://github.com/AtoposX-J/CVE-2026-34197-Apache-ActiveMQ-RCE","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-34197"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0099.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0099.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0099.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0262","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0262.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-34760","title":"vLLM 多声道音频混音算法不一致安全绕过漏洞","description":"vLLM 推理服务引擎在处理多声道音频时，默认使用 Librosa 库的 numpy.mean 进行声道下混（to_mono），而国际标准 ITU-R BS.775-4 规定了加权混音算法，两者存在处理差异。攻击者可利用此差异构造特制多声道音频，使人类听到的内容与 AI 模型处理的内容不一致，从而绕过内容审核机制。该漏洞影响 vLLM 0.5.5 至 0.18.0 之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.9，危害等级中危。官方已在 0.18.0 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-34760","GHSA-6c4r-fmh3-7rh8"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-04-02T20:16:25Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:39:34Z","remediation":"立即将 vLLM 升级至 0.18.0 或以上版本（于 2026 年发布，包含该修复）。如无法立即升级，可修改音频预处理管线，将降混算法替换为 ITU-R BS.775-4 加权算法（参考 librosa 的 `to_mono` 实现，改用 `librosa.core.resample` 配合权重矩阵），并增加音频输入的内容安全校验机制以防范隐式注入攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/c7f98b4d0a63b32ed939e2b6dfaa8a626e9b46c4","https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/37058","https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/releases/tag/v0.18.0","https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/security/advisories/GHSA-6c4r-fmh3-7rh8","https://github.com/Tencent/AI-Infra-Guard/blob/184a4cd474c4aaa5a27dac20b468f57966faa421/data/vuln/vllm/CVE-2026-34760.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2026/34xxx/CVE-2026-34760.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/4d1eebacb731643a646e28a4f60e64dd753a5ff4/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-34760.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/vllm/CVE-2026-34760.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a5255477d5a184aa815a0febf0096e43251805cf/2026/34xxx/CVE-2026-34760.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-34760.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-34760.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/deaa43929ec54780e2eb376ab2d9b7b05edd5031/cve/CVE-2026-34760.html","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/aad1d5d7fcfd4bf7bee792090d157de726946a96/vulns/vllm/PYSEC-2026-2299.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-6c4r-fmh3-7rh8/GHSA-6c4r-fmh3-7rh8.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0262.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0978","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0978.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-3775","title":"Foxit PDF Reader 搜索路径劫持本地提权漏洞","description":"某应用程序的更新服务在检查更新时，会从包含低权限用户可写目录的搜索路径中加载系统库，且未严格限制为受信任的系统位置。由于这些库可能从用户可写位置解析并加载，本地攻击者可将恶意库文件放置于该路径，使其以 SYSTEM 权限被加载执行，从而导致本地权限提升和任意代码执行。该漏洞影响范围广泛，攻击者只需拥有本地低权限即可利用，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-3775"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-04-01T02:16:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:44:11Z","remediation":"立即将 Foxit PDF Reader 升级至 2026.1.2 及以上版本，Foxit PDF Editor 升级至 2026.1.2 及以上版本。可在软件内点击「帮助」→「关于」→「检查更新」自动升级，或从 Foxit 官网下载最新安装包。临时缓解措施：移除 Foxit Update Service 搜索路径中用户可写目录的写入权限，或通过组策略限制低权限用户对系统库加载路径的写入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.foxit.com/support/security-bulletins.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2026/CVE-2026-3775.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8f86f3866df0d1c5d8aff409ea4847883047cbe6/cves/2026/3xxx/CVE-2026-3775.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4683223ae150496144b181156e51d2b32e6b15f8/2026/3xxx/CVE-2026-3775.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-3775.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/5f5abbd8608de32353d4b1190991d6df75c2631f/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-3775.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a8ca4b37f0ada74ec6b08db2309dab894440907e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-3775.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-3775.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/15bf95c7b4616c8551a2bd666d40a8a1a07282d6/2026/CVE-2026-57239.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-3775.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-37xx/CVE-2026-3775.json","https://github.com/Paradoxis/CVE-2026-57239","https://github.com/menevarad007/CVE-2026-37750"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0978.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0739","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0739.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-34054","title":"Microsoft vcpkg OpenSSL路径劫持漏洞","description":"vcpkg 是一款开源的 C/C++ 包管理器。在 3.6.1#3 版本之前，其 Windows 版本的 OpenSSL 构建将 openssldir 硬编码为构建机器上的路径，导致该路径在客户机器上可被劫持。攻击者若能在该硬编码路径下植入恶意 OpenSSL 配置文件或库文件，即可在受害者运行使用该 OpenSSL 的应用程序时实现代码执行或权限提升。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响 vcpkg 版本构建的 Windows 应用程序，CVSS 评分 7.8（HIGH），攻击向量为本地（AV:L），需低权限（PR:L）且无需用户交互（UI:N）。Microsoft 已在 vcpkg 3.6.1#3 中修复此问题，建议用户升级至该版本或更高版本并重新构建应用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-34054"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-03-31T03:15:58Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:38:29Z","remediation":"建议立即升级vcpkg到3.6.1#3或更高版本，该版本修复了OpenSSL的openssldir路径劫持问题。升级后，请确保使用新的vcpkg.toml配置文件指定正确的openssldir路径。如无法立即升级，可通过环境变量SSL_DIR设置正确目录以临时缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/commit/5111afdf55cc1429d9951e4c7b02010e659346a9","https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/pull/50518","https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/security/advisories/GHSA-p322-v6vw-vrq9","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fd4c668e0b43bf25cada98d9b000adcf7f4c176f/cves/2026/34xxx/CVE-2026-34054.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c3b619fb02eed1c084cf7dca0b26d6106b797434/2026/34xxx/CVE-2026-34054.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ce969f677dfe522c3ff889eb16df65adf8a52833/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-34054.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ce969f677dfe522c3ff889eb16df65adf8a52833/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-34054.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-34054.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-34054.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/93d966ccbf562a1a0fe2dcab2089012ce2b11591/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-340xx/CVE-2026-34054.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/21c462a94ea67aa3df9bc7055065922b0908d166/content/posts/cve-2026-34054.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/790c2d6c2f00f7f154de7420ee269c333853d9a4/2026/CVE-2026-34054.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/0be0a401ab20dd1e1044a1d0a869b6a5e8de7fb8/api/2026/CVE-2026-34054.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0739.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0073","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0073.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-33701","title":"OpenTelemetry Java Agent RMI 反序列化远程代码执行漏洞","description":"OpenTelemetry Java Instrumentation 的 RMI 组件存在反序列化漏洞（CWE-502），版本低于 2.26.1 时注册了自定义端点且未设置序列化过滤器，攻击者通过网络访问受监控 JVM 的 JMX/RMI 端口即可触发反序列化攻击，在 JDK 16 及更早版本上实现远程代码执行。利用需满足三个条件：Java Agent 方式附加于 JDK ≤16、JMX/RMI 端口显式配置且网络可达、classpath 中存在 gadget 链依赖库，攻击成功后可获取 JVM 进程权限执行任意代码。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重，影响所有使用 OpenTelemetry Java Agent < 2.26.1 的 JDK ≤16 环境。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-33701"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-03-27T01:16:19Z","updated":"2026-07-15T02:20:14Z","remediation":"升级 OpenTelemetry Java Instrumentation 至 2.26.1 或更高版本。如使用 JDK 16 及以下版本且无法立即升级，可设置系统属性 `-Dotel.instrumentation.rmi.enabled=false` 禁用 RMI 集成作为临时缓解措施。JDK 17+ 默认不受影响，仍建议升级至最新版本。同时避免将 JMX/RMI 端口暴露在网络上。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/commit/9cf4fbaaa9e79226142b2ed42a6f6b4ac0be2197","https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/releases/tag/v2.26.1","https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/security/advisories/GHSA-xw7x-h9fj-p2c7","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-33701","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2452071","https://security.access.redhat.com/data/csaf/v2/vex/2026/cve-2026-33701.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4f761f58350f835cb02025d033f6f8c7f536e6b7/cves/2026/33xxx/CVE-2026-33701.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-33701.md","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/2c33615177891dff53dbcfc2995a0c3e61ee79e1/proposals/euvd/CVE-2026-33701.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/datahub-project/datahub/blob/87827ab1b37aca709a847a225a3c610e51d65e80/docs/how/updating-datahub.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-03-27/TIER_2_CVE-2026-33701.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/d17870d3de3988e949c161d788c25e4dfe158dac/2026/CVE-2026-33701.json","https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/blob/61bc2025df2192304829df1a3ef44e7371d36719/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2026-33701","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/39b22452fe579e54bd7f5c66d1416f8c94c190d0/content/posts/cve-2026-33701.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ccf2cc3d762789b06638ba5aa3e06982a53080c8/maven/io.opentelemetry.javaagent/opentelemetry-javaagent/CVE-2026-33701.yml","https://github.com/pl4tyz/CVE-2026-33701-Unsafe-Deserialization-in-OpenTelemetry-Java-Agent-RMI-Instrumentation","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-33701"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0073.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0511","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0511.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-20695","title":"Apple macOS 内核内存信息泄露漏洞","description":"macOS 内核存在内存管理缺陷导致的信息泄露漏洞。由于内核内存管理机制对内存布局信息的访问控制不足，本地攻击者可通过运行恶意应用程序读取内核内存布局数据，从而获取敏感内核信息。该漏洞有助于攻击者绕过内核地址空间布局随机化（KASLR）等安全机制，为后续提权攻击提供信息支撑。攻击者无需获取用户权限或用户交互即可利用，但需要本地访问能力。Apple 已在 macOS Sequoia 15.7.5、macOS Sonoma 14.8.5 及 macOS Tahoe 26.4 中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2026-20695"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-03-25T01:17:06Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:17:42Z","remediation":"立即将 macOS 升级至 Sequoia 15.7.5、Sonoma 14.8.5 或 Tahoe 26.4 及以上版本（通过系统设置 > 软件更新安装）。该漏洞通过改进内存管理修复了内核内存布局泄露问题，本地无权限应用可读取内核内存布局信息。如无法立即升级，建议限制不可信应用的安装与运行，并启用 macOS 的 Gatekeeper 和 SIP（系统完整性保护）以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://support.apple.com/en-us/126794","https://support.apple.com/en-us/126795","https://support.apple.com/en-us/126796","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2026/20xxx/CVE-2026-20695.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/13cb9776e1a75871fdb2907e6c4ccac1909e538b/2026/20xxx/CVE-2026-20695.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-20695.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2026-20695","https://github.com/0xcrypto/applesec/blob/329509dbe1145b3843ce31e10b6d3490a1ab8909/content/macOS/Medium/CVE-2026-20695.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2026/03/GHSA-53m2-g697-36jw/GHSA-53m2-g697-36jw.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/mitre/CVE-2026-20695","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-20695.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7418aa4f1c4590a239ce7ccd2c9efba72e268cc5/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-20695.json","https://github.com/Proteas/apple-cve/blob/83ebab7aae147262897ff321980205e90a6eb8ab/2026/2026.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0511.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0509","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0509.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-20690","title":"Apple 多系统音频处理越界访问漏洞","description":"Apple 多系统音频处理组件存在越界读取漏洞（CWE-125），在处理恶意构造的媒体文件中的音频流时，由于边界检查不充分，攻击者可通过诱导用户打开特制媒体文件触发越界读取，导致进程异常终止，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 iOS 18.7.7/iPadOS 18.7.7、iOS 26.4/iPadOS 26.4、macOS Sequoia 15.7.5/Sonoma 14.8.5/Tahoe 26.4、tvOS 26.4、visionOS 26.4 及 watchOS 26.4 等多个 Apple 操作系统版本。攻击需要用户交互，远程攻击者无法直接利用，CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中危。Apple 已在 2026 年 3 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-20690"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-03-25T01:17:05Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:17:42Z","remediation":"建议立即将受影响设备升级至以下安全版本：iOS 18.7.7 / iOS 26.4、iPadOS 18.7.7 / iPadOS 26.4、macOS Sequoia 15.7.5 / Sonoma 14.8.5 / Tahoe 26.4、tvOS 26.4、visionOS 26.4、watchOS 26.4。可通过「设置」→「通用」→「软件更新」获取最新版本。临时缓解措施：避免在受影响设备上打开来源不明的媒体文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://support.apple.com/en-us/126792","https://support.apple.com/en-us/126793","https://support.apple.com/en-us/126794","https://support.apple.com/en-us/126795","https://support.apple.com/en-us/126796","https://support.apple.com/en-us/126797","https://support.apple.com/en-us/126798","https://support.apple.com/en-us/126799","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2026/20xxx/CVE-2026-20690.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/13cb9776e1a75871fdb2907e6c4ccac1909e538b/2026/20xxx/CVE-2026-20690.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-20690.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2026-20690","https://github.com/0xcrypto/applesec/blob/329509dbe1145b3843ce31e10b6d3490a1ab8909/content/iOS/Medium/CVE-2026-20690.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2026/03/GHSA-9q8x-28q7-g3j2/GHSA-9q8x-28q7-g3j2.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/mitre/CVE-2026-20690","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-20690.md","https://github.com/macadmins/sofa/blob/436770d9bd5d49087b8412e5f31133606c2f0e2b/data/resources/history/bulletin_data_2026-04-11_12-49-19.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/a7af5a678b55af1e4884963bdb9ea6fae03d5b34/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-206xx/CVE-2026-20690.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0509.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0523","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0523.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-24157","title":"NVIDIA NeMo Framework 检查点加载远程代码执行漏洞","description":"NVIDIA NeMo Framework 在检查点加载功能中存在反序列化漏洞（CWE-502），由于未对用户提供的检查点数据进行充分验证，攻击者可通过构造恶意的模型检查点文件诱导用户加载，触发反序列化过程中的远程代码执行。成功利用该漏洞可导致代码执行、权限提升、信息泄露及数据篡改。攻击者需具备本地访问权限且需用户交互，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-24157"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-03-24T21:16:27Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:22:43Z","remediation":"立即将 NVIDIA NeMo Framework 升级至 2.6.2 或更高版本，可通过 `pip install --upgrade nemo-toolkit>=2.6.2` 或从 https://github.com/NVIDIA/NeMo 拉取最新代码更新。如无法立即升级，应禁止加载来源不可信的 checkpoint 文件，并在加载外部模型检查点时实施严格的输入验证与反序列化白名单机制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-24157","https://nvidia.custhelp.com/app/answers/detail/a_id/5800","https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2026-24157","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2026/24xxx/CVE-2026-24157.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/886e3cd9cda40e2c4ffda31042908f1a83f89624/proposals/nvidia-psirt/CVE-2026-24157.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/04aa8ca564639267b9d3e24749bc97bd87299d48/2026/24xxx/CVE-2026-24157.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/pypi/nemo-toolkit/CVE-2026-24157.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-24157.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-24157.md","https://github.com/NVIDIA/product-security/blob/87cba624878101147040549f75f4b9bb6b69df37/2026/5800/5800.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/03/GHSA-m4jw-wgmf-889x/GHSA-m4jw-wgmf-889x.json","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/3926520bcc5671ddd00549bf2242a2082ef49d3d/vulns/nemo-toolkit/PYSEC-2026-2674.yaml","https://github.com/promptfoo/modelaudit/blob/47f94eef3feba8e74c517114094e035c7ea837e8/docs/maintainers/scanner-cve-coverage.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0523.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-1100","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-1100.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-4698","title":"Mozilla Firefox 和 Thunderbird JavaScript 引擎远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Firefox 及 Thunderbird 的 JavaScript 引擎 JIT 组件存在误编译漏洞（CWE-843 类型混淆、CWE-733 编译器优化移除），攻击者通过构造恶意 JavaScript 代码可触发 JIT 编译器生成错误代码，导致内存损坏并实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Firefox 149 以下版本、Firefox ESR 115.34 和 140.9 以下版本，以及 Thunderbird 149 和 140.9 以下版本。攻击者需诱导用户访问恶意网页或打开包含恶意脚本的邮件内容，在浏览器沙箱内以用户权限执行任意代码。Mozilla 已在 Firefox 149、Firefox ESR 115.34、Firefox ESR 140.9、Thunderbird 149 和 Thunderbird 140.9 中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-4698"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-03-24T13:16:05Z","updated":"2026-07-15T02:22:50Z","remediation":"升级 Firefox 至 149 或更高版本（Firefox 148 及更早版本不会获得修复），Firefox ESR 115 升级至 115.34 或更高版本，Firefox ESR 140 升级至 140.9 或更高版本；Thunderbird 升级至 149 或 140.9 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在 about:config 中将 javascript.options.jit 设置为 false 禁用 JIT 编译作为临时缓解措施，但这会影响网页性能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2020906","https://www.mozilla.org/security/advisories/mfsa2026-20/","https://www.mozilla.org/security/advisories/mfsa2026-21/","https://www.mozilla.org/security/advisories/mfsa2026-22/","https://www.mozilla.org/security/advisories/mfsa2026-23/","https://www.mozilla.org/security/advisories/mfsa2026-24/","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:5930","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:5931","https://access.red