fb8e5378e5129c94325e4e/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-4698.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b31a8b82a1e35acc79fb8e5378e5129c94325e4e/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-4698.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/8a9f1e134a847eb59530b63828f75867023ec363/reports/2026-03-24/TIER_2_CVE-2026-4698.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-4698.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/07f0931dd35f996dbf6b1a3296eaf61225fd7563/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-4698"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-1100.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0077","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0077.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-3055","title":"Citrix NetScaler ADC/Gateway SAML IDP 内存越界读取漏洞","description":"Citrix NetScaler ADC 和 NetScaler Gateway 在配置为 SAML 身份提供商（IdP）时存在输入验证不足漏洞，导致内存越界读取（CWE-125）。远程攻击者可通过向 /saml/login 或 /wsfed/passive 端点发送特制 SAML 请求触发该漏洞，造成敏感信息泄露或潜在内存破坏。该漏洞影响 NS 14.1 及 13.1 系列版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。厂商已在 NS 14.1-66.59+ 及 13.1-62.23+ 版本中修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-3055"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-03-23T21:17:17Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:42:58Z","remediation":"立即升级至 NetScaler 14.1-66.59 及以上版本，或 13.1-62.23 及以上版本（FIPS/NDcPP 环境需升级至 13.1-37.262+）。如无法立即升级，在 WAF 或防火墙上拦截 `/saml/login` 和 `/wsfed/passive` 路径的外部访问，并限制仅允许可信 IP 白名单访问 SAML IdP 端点。若业务允许，执行 `rm authentication samlIdPProfile` 命令禁用 SAML IdP 配置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://support.citrix.com/support-home/kbsearch/article?articleNumber=CTX696300","https://labs.watchtowr.com/please-we-beg-just-one-weekend-free-of-appliances-citrix-netscaler-cve-2026-3055-memory-overread-part-2/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2026-3055","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2026/CVE-2026-3055.yaml","https://github.com/fevar54/CVE-2026-3055---Citrix-NetScaler-Memory-Overread-PoC","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/47b5b37845c422b41f7f77baee4751638de71f26/http/cves/2026/CVE-2026-3055.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e37edb84f090321c2ab4b4aefc57f84a75b1b940/cves/2026/3xxx/CVE-2026-3055.json","https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework/blob/7c9fd4e653786d40d51f383be1f91993efddadf8/modules/auxiliary/scanner/http/citrix_netscaler_cve_2026_3055.rb","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/1b6397ca00ebc515023ce73df945527011e5cc49/2026/CVE-2026-30556.md","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/edea45bcf3f5f232d6349d094e3ed87f8aba3ba7/doc/2026-03/CVE-2026-3055%EF%BD%9CCitrix%20NetScaler%20ADC%E5%92%8CNetScaler%20Gateway%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E8%B6%8A%E7%95%8C%E8%AF%BB%E5%8F%96%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-3055.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/25d022b09657fe844947d1b6e33693a31318f832/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2026-3055","https://github.com/XiaomingX/data-cve-poc-py-v1/blob/2384dcccef665cfd62dafa8a075b204cad1f98e9/2026/CVE-2026-3055/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/39b22452fe579e54bd7f5c66d1416f8c94c190d0/content/posts/cve-2026-3055.md","https://github.com/l0lsec/check-cve-2026-3055-netscaler","https://github.com/fevar54/CVE-2026-3055-Scanner---Herramienta-de-Detecci-n","https://github.com/0xBlackash/CVE-2026-3055","https://github.com/NetVanguard-cmd/CVE-2026-3055","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-3055"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0077.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0514","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0514.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-22898","title":"QNAP QVR Pro 关键功能身份验证绕过漏洞","description":"QVR Pro 存在关键功能身份验证缺失漏洞（CWE-306），未经身份认证的远程攻击者无需任何权限即可利用该漏洞绕过身份验证机制，直接访问系统敏感功能并获取完全控制权限。该漏洞影响 QVR Pro 各版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。QNAP 已在 QVR Pro 2.7.4.14 及后续版本中修复此漏洞，建议用户立即升级。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-22898"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-03-20T17:16:44Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:20:34Z","remediation":"立即将 QVR Pro 升级至 2.7.4.14 或更高版本，可通过 QNAP App Center 或手动下载安装包更新。如无法立即升级，建议在防火墙/反向代理层面限制对 QVR Pro 管理端口的公网访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接，并启用 QNAP 的访问保护功能（如 IP 白名单、双因素认证）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.qnap.com/en/security-advisory/qsa-26-07","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2026/22xxx/CVE-2026-22898.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-03-20/TIER_2_CVE-2026-22898.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/13cb9776e1a75871fdb2907e6c4ccac1909e538b/2026/22xxx/CVE-2026-22898.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-22898.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2026-22898","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-22898.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2026/03/GHSA-2f6v-45w8-wr99/GHSA-2f6v-45w8-wr99.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/mitre/CVE-2026-22898","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7418aa4f1c4590a239ce7ccd2c9efba72e268cc5/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-22898.json","https://github.com/kidrek/VigilIntel/blob/5c40d7f3362ab33435de1b09462e6122b81573b4/2026/